  "body": "Looking for four bedrooms, flexible living, freehold ownership and a fantastic Stanmore Bay location? Your search may just be over. Why you'll love it:\r\n\r\n- Four spacious, well-sized bedrooms\r\n- Excellent cupboard and storage space throughout\r\n- Light-filled open-plan living\r\n- Sunny outdoor entertaining and deck\r\n- Versatile tandem garage\r\n- Work-from-home or play-space flexibility\r\n- Ample off-street parking\r\n\r\nWelcome to 21 Seafarer Crescent - and prepare to be pleasantly surprised by just how spacious this home feels. With four genuinely well-sized bedrooms, excellent cupboard and storage space, and a clever layout that makes great use of every square metre, there's plenty of room here for busy family life without feeling cramped.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is the light-filled open-plan living area, flowing easily outdoors to a sunny deck and relaxed entertaining space. Fire up the BBQ, invite the friends around or simply settle in and enjoy those long summer afternoons.\r\n\r\nThen there's the tandem garage, which the owners have cleverly utilised part of this space as a work-from-home and kids' play area. Office, gym, hobbies, extra storage or somewhere for the teenagers to escape to - you decide.\r\n\r\nAnd the location? Fantastic for families and everyday convenience, with so much within easy reach. You're right in the heart of Stanmore Bay, where the relaxed coastal lifestyle the Hibiscus Coast is known for is practically on your doorstep. Beautiful Arkles Bay Beach, Coast Plaza, a great selection of cafés and eateries, local schools, parks and everyday amenities are all close by - making this a location that's as convenient as it is enjoyable.\r\n\r\nThe opportunity is here! Welcome to 21 Seafarer Crescent - come and see it for yourself.",
